flowchart LR
  Browser[Browser UI]
  FrontendApp[React Frontend (recruitbot-web / public)]
  API[HTTP API]
  Server[Express Server (src/server.ts)]
  Ingest[Ingestion Pipeline (loaders, parsers)]
  Retrieval[Retrieval Pipeline (hybrid/vector/keyword)]
  Reranker[LLM Reranker (optional)]
  Memory[Chat Memory]
  VectorStore[Vector Store (MongoDBAtlasVectorSearch)]
  MongoDB[(MongoDB Atlas)]
  Models[LLM Providers (groq / openai / anthropic / mistralai)]
  DocumentStorage[Uploads / documents/]

  Browser --> FrontendApp
  FrontendApp -->|API calls| API
  API --> Server
  Server --> Ingest
  Server --> Retrieval
  Server --> Memory
  Ingest --> DocumentStorage
  Ingest --> VectorStore
  Retrieval --> VectorStore
  Retrieval --> Reranker
  Reranker --> Models
  Retrieval --> Models
  VectorStore --> MongoDB
  Server -->|uses| Models

  %% simplified: removed classDef styling to avoid syntax issues in some mermaid versions
